        },
        {
          "text": "Mwidha kubanga ba idembe okutoola amagoba ku basenze nga mubawoze. Aye mutatoolanga magoba ku Baisiraeli banaimwe be muwoze. Olwo Musengwa Katonda waimwe abaghenga enkabi mu byonabyona bye munaakolanga, eyo mu nsi ye muja okutwala okuba obutaka bwaimwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
