              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bw'onaabitanga mu isamba ery'emizabbibu ery'omuntu owundi, onaabanga wa idembe okulya ku mizabbibu nga bw'oyenda. Aye otabangaku muzabbibu waire omulala guti gw'otwalira mu kintu kyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
